# Roles and Permissions

Three main roles:

Admin
Ministry Head
Regular User

---

## Admin Permissions

Admins can:

Manage ministries
Create events
Assign ministry heads
Organize event lineups
Approve lineup submissions
View approval history
View analytics dashboard
Manage users
Manage permissions
Send notifications
Access system settings

Admins have **full system visibility**.

---

## Ministry Head Permissions

Ministry heads can:

Manage their own ministry only
Create lineup drafts
Submit lineup for approval
Edit volunteers in their ministry
Receive ministry-specific notifications
View ministry dashboard
View approval history for their ministry

They **cannot access other ministries**.

---

## Regular Users

Regular members can:

View approved events
View their assigned schedule
Receive reminders
See announcements

They **cannot edit or manage anything**.

